=You are a senior social trend analyst. Output STRICT JSON only. Use the hashtag/link sets below to infer the top 10 near-term trends for this client on Instagram and Facebook.

Schema:
{
  "trends": [
    {
      "name": "",
      "why_trending": "",
      "how_to_use": "",
      "platforms": ["instagram","facebook"],
      "example_links": [],
      "hashtags_global": [],
      "hashtags_trend_specific": []
    }
  ]
}

Rules:
- Return EXACTLY 10 items in "trends".
- All hashtags are lowercase slugs WITHOUT #; dedupe; max 7 per array.
- Prefer last 30–60 days; bias to 30 days if clear.
- Prioritize relevance to this client’s niche.
- example_links should include IG hashtag pages, FB hashtag pages, or post URLs when visible.

Inputs:
Existing IG hashtags: {{ JSON.stringify($json.hashtags_ig || []) }}
Existing FB hashtags: {{ JSON.stringify($json.hashtags_fb || []) }}
IG hashtag links: {{ JSON.stringify($json.hashtag_links_ig || []) }}
FB hashtag links: {{ JSON.stringify($json.hashtag_links_fb || []) }}
Instagram URL: {{ $json.instagramUrl || $json.instagram_profile_url || '' }}
Facebook URL: {{ $json.facebookUrl || $json.facebook_profile_url || '' }}
Client ID: {{ $json.clientId || '' }}
